      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 66,
        "endIndex": 361,
        "text": "### Candidate [0]: Tencent Releases Hy4 Preview Foundational Model\n* **What is confirmed:** On August 28, 2026, Tencent released and open-sourced **Hy4 Preview**, a Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) foundation model featuring 770 billion total parameters (49B active) and a 1-million-token context window"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 363,
        "endIndex": 554,
        "text": "Tencent reports that internal blind evaluations show Hy4 Preview slightly outperforming GLM 5.3 and Kimi K3 (Moonshot) on productivity tasks, coding, office analytics, and scientific research"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        2,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 556,
        "endIndex": 727,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** The performance leadership claims rely on internal blind tests and benchmarks published by Tencent rather than independent third-party evaluations"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        2,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 773,
        "endIndex": 814,
        "text": "** Strong in-scope AI model release story"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 822,
        "endIndex": 1184,
        "text": "### Candidate [4]: Nvidia Reportedly Acquiring Hugging Face for ~$13 Billion\n* **What is confirmed:** Major media outlets (The Information, Business Insider, Forbes) reported on August 26–27, 2026, that Nvidia is in advanced negotiations or has reached an agreement to acquire open-source AI platform Hugging Face for approximately $12.9 billion to $13 billion"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        3,
        4,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
